  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk / Tax Collector | Rye, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\n             Rye Website Changes \n\tNew Website Updates! Use Ryenh.gov to find current pages!\r\n\t Click Here To Find Out More \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     About Rye  \t\t\t \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards   \t\t\t \n     Visitor Information   \t\t\t \n     Find It Fast   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t Beach Parking Permit Policy \r\n\t\t\t Deliberative Session Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Dog License Information \r\n\t\t\t Downloadable Forms \r\n\t\t\t Election Results \r\n\t\t\t Genealogical Research \r\n\t\t\t How to Register to Vote in NH \r\n\t\t\t Marriage License Information \r\n\t\t\t Motor Vehicle Registrations \r\n\t\t\t NH Hardship Relief Program \r\n\t\t\t Online Property Tax and Sewer Bill Payments \r\n\t\t\t Tax Exemption Information \r\n\t\t\t Town Officials \r\n\t\t\t Town Ordinances \r\n\t\t\t Voting & Elections \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk / Tax Collector \r\nTown Clerk / Tax Collector\t\t \r\nRye Town Clerk/Tax Collector \nTown Clerk / Tax Collector Services \nWe are happy to assist you with: \n• Motor Vehicle Registrations — New, Transfer & Renewals \n• Dog Licenses \n• Property Tax Bills \n• Sewer Bills \n• Vital Record Requests \n• Voter Registration & Party Changes \n• Absentee Ballots \nA Few Helpful Reminders: \n🚗 Motor Vehicle transactions are processed until  4:00 PM  each day. \n💍 Marriage Licenses are available  by appointment only . \n🏡  New to Town? Welcome!  If you need to transfer or register  more than two vehicles , please contact our office to schedule an appointment. This allows us to provide you with the time and attention needed to complete your registrations efficiently. \nStaff Contacts \nName Title Phone \nAmy Thibodeau Town Clerk / Tax Collector 603-964-8562 \nLindsay Murphy Deputy Town Clerk / Tax Collector 603-964-8562 \nLori Lavigne Assistant Town Clerk/Tax Collector 603-964-8562 \r\nContact Us \r\nTown of Rye NH Town Clerk / Tax Collector \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n View Map \t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t Rye Town Hall \n\t\t\t\t\t\t 500 Washington Road \n\t\t\t\t\t Rye ,  NH   03870 \r\nRye Town Hall 500 Washington Road Rye NH 03870 \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t Directions \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Mailing Address \n\t\t\t\t\t PO Box 515 \n\t\t\t\t\t Rye ,  NH   03870 \r\nPhone:  (603) 964-8562 \r\nFax: (603) 964-1587 \r\nHours of Operation \nMonday to Thursday: \n8 am to 4:30 pm \nFridays: \n8 am to noon \r\nDirectory \r\nNews Flash \r\n\t Trick or Treat!  \r\n\t\t\t\t Read on... \r\n\t Rye Municipal Facilities and Services Master Plan - Feedback Form  \r\nThe Town of Rye would like to develop a comprehensive Municipal Facilities and Services Master Plan to guide decisions about municipal investments and service delivery over the next 10 to 20 years.  You can help by completing our feedback form.\t\t\t\t Read on... \r\n\t 2026 General Election Sample Ballot  \r\n\t\t\t\t Read on... \r\n\t\t View All News \r\n/CivicAlerts.aspx \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Subscribe to E-Alerts \r\n\t\t\t Contact Us \r\n\t\t\t Volunteer \r\n\t\t\t Town Ordinances \r\n\t\t\t Forms & Documents \r\nContact Us \r\nTown of Rye, New Hampshire \n10 Central Road, \r\nRye, NH 03870 \r\nPhone:  603-964-5523 \r\nHours: Mon - Fri 8:00am - 4:30pm \r\nPopular Pages \r\n         Town Officials \n         Video Streaming \n         Employment Opportunities \n         Schools \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nSite Links \r\n         Accessibility \n         Site Map \n         Copyright Notices \n         Contact Us \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
